    "en": "Near-Earth asteroids, the Earth seen by EPIC and natural events near you, from NASA open data.",
    "fr": "Astéroïdes proches, la Terre vue par EPIC et événements naturels autour de vous (NASA).",
    "de": "Erdnahe Asteroiden, die Erde von EPIC gesehen und Naturereignisse in deiner Nähe (NASA).",
    "es": "Asteroides cercanos, la Tierra vista por EPIC y eventos naturales cerca de usted (NASA)."
  },
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/william-de71/gladys-nasa:0.1.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.3.0",
